<title>THAILAND: Thai 1997 Q1 inflation rose 4.4 pct-central bank.</title>
<headline>Thai 1997 Q1 inflation rose 4.4 pct-central bank.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's inflation rose 4.4 percent in the first quarter of 1997, a sharp drop from 7.3 percent posted during the same year ago period, the Bank of Thailand said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
